2026-02-27 15:54:36 | INFO     | app.llm_hub.inference:_extract_content:717 - [36m提取内容成功: [{'finish_reason': 'stop', 'index': 0, 'logprobs': None, 'message': {'content': '我来为您编写一个快速排序算法的Python实现，并包含完整的测试代码。\n\n## 快速排序算法实现\n\n```python\ndef quick_sort(arr):\n    """\n    快速排序算法实现\n    """\n    if len(arr) <= 1:\n        return arr\n    \n    pivot = arr[len(arr) // 2]  # 选择中间元素作为基准\n    left = [x for x in arr if x < pivot]\n    middle = [x for x in arr if x == pivot]\n    right = [x for x in arr if x > pivot]\n    \n    return quick_sort(left) + middle + quick_sort(right)\n\ndef quick_sort_inplace(arr, low=0, high=None):\n    """\n    原地快速排序算法实现（节省空间）\n    """\n    if high is None:\n        high = len(arr) - 1\n    \n    if low < high:\n        # 分区操作\n        pivot_index = partition(arr, low, high)\n        \n        # 递归排序左右子数组\n        quick_sort_inplace(arr, low, pivot_index - 1)\n        quick_sort_inplace(arr, pivot_index + 1, high)\n\ndef partition(arr, low, high):\n    """\n    分区函数，用于原地快速排序\n    """\n    pivot = arr[high]  # 选择最后一个元素作为基准\n    i = low - 1  # 较小元素的索引\n    \n    for j in range(low, high):\n        if arr[j] <= pivot:\n            i += 1\n            arr[i], arr[j] = arr[j], arr[i]\n    \n    arr[i + 1], arr[high] = arr[high], arr[i + 1]\n    return i + 1\n```\n\n## 测试代码\n\n```python\ndef test_quick_sort():\n    """\n    测试快速排序算法\n    """\n    print("=== 快速排序算法测试 ===")\n    \n    # 测试用例1：普通数组\n    test1 = [64, 34, 25, 12, 22, 11, 90]\n    print(f"测试用例1 - 原始数组: {test1}")\n    result1 = quick_sort(test1.copy())\n    print(f"排序结果: {result1}")\n    print(f"是否正确排序: {result1 == sorted(test1)}")\n    print()\n    \n    # 测试用例2：已排序数组\n    test2 = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n    print(f"测试用例2 - 已排序数组: {test2}")\n    result2 = quick_sort(test2.copy())\n    print(f"排序结果: {result2}")\n    print(f"是否正确排序: {result2 == sorted(test2)}")\n    print()\n    \n    # 测试用例3：逆序数组\n    test3 = [5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\n    print(f"测试用例3 - 逆序数组: {test3}")\n    result3 = quick_sort(test3.copy())\n    print(f"排序结果: {result3}")\n    print(f"是否正确排序: {result3 == sorted(test3)}")\n    print()\n    \n    # 测试用例4：包含重复元素的数组\n    test4 = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6, 5, 3, 5]\n    print(f"测试用例4 - 包含重复元素: {test4}")\n    result4 = quick_sort(test4.copy())\n    print(f"排序结果: {result4}")\n    print(f"是否正确排序: {result4 == sorted(test4)}")\n    print()\n    \n    # 测试用例5：空数组\n    test5 = []\n    print(f"测试用例5 - 空数组: {test5}")\n    result5 = quick_sort(test5.copy())\n    print(f"排序结果: {result5}")\n    print(f"是否正确排序: {result5 == sorted(test5)}")\n    print()\n    \n    # 测试用例6：单元素数组\n    test6 = [42]\n    print(f"测试用例6 - 单元素数组: {test6}")\n    result6 = quick_sort(test6.copy())\n    print(f"排序结果: {result6}")\n    print(f"是否正确排序: {result6 == sorted(test6)}")\n    print()\n    \n    # 测试原地排序版本\n    print("=== 原地快速排序测试 ===")\n    test7 = [64, 34, 25, 12, 22, 11, 90]\n    print(f"测试用例 - 原始数组: {test7}")\n    quick_sort_inplace(test7)\n    print(f"排序结果: {test7}")\n    print(f"是否正确排序: {test7 == sorted(test7)}")\n\n# 运行测试\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    test_quick_sort()\n```\n\n## 算法特点\n\n**快速排序的优势：**\n- 平均时间复杂度：O(n log n)\n- 原地排序版本节省空间\n- 在实际应用中通常比其他 O(n log n) 算法更快\n\n**算法原理：**\n1. 选择一个基准元素（pivot）\n2. 将数组分为三部分：小于基准、等于基准、大于基准\n3. 递归地对左右两部分进行快速排序\n4. 合并结果\n\n这个实现包含了两种版本：一种是返回新数组的函数式版本，另一种是原地排序的版本。测试代码涵盖了各种边界情况，确保算法的正确性。', 'refusal': None, 'role': 'assistant', 'annotations': None, 'audio': None, 'function_call': None, 'tool_calls': []}}][0m
